      "updated": 1793700123122,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "--> We provide different types of data connections through technologies like :\n        ° OpenShift Data Foundation\n\n        ° IBM storage\n    and \n        ° the S3 protocol that could either :\n            * be local \n         or \n            ° could be utilizing something like AWS3",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
